@@ -46,15 +46,17 @@ numeric_form_without_expression	GUARD	-	parser guarantee: NUMERIC FORM VALUE wit
 object_method	GUARD	-	Task 4 report, "Kept with owner None": .object~define, .string~inherit (98.985), SETMETHOD to an Array or String (97.2), setMethod, unsetMethod and setMethod OBJECT from methods of Directory, .local, .environment and a Directory subclass; all answer or raise, oracle-identical
 op_not_driven	GUARD	-	driver invariant: every op the compiler emits has a driver arm (census d-guard)
 operator_operand	GUARD	-	scout A b12: spec-op.txt, every dyadic and prefix operator on nine left operands, refused none
 parse_trigger_operand	GUARD	-	parser guarantee: a PARSE trigger that needs an operand carries one (census d-guard)
 receiver_class	DEVIATION	-	oracle-crashes.txt entry 33 and Deviation 28: a primitive's native method run on an object of another class crashes the oracle or answers an accident of memory; Task 4 probes b2_run_*_on_inst, Task 7 probes rc2, rc3
 register_not_logical	GUARD	-	compiler invariant: a branch reads a register holding a logical (census d-guard)
 scheduler_inconsistency	GUARD	-	scheduler invariant (refusal-sites.tsv: guarded_getter_waits_for_reply.rex agrees)
 select_op_off_its_node	GUARD	-	compiler invariant: a SELECT op names its own SELECT (census d-guard)
 setup_method	GUARD	-	scout A b15: b_define_class_method_setup, b_inherit_instance_methods are 97.1 on both engines
 signal_op_off_its_node	GUARD	-	compiler invariant: a Signal op matches its SIGNAL's form (census d-guard)
+sim_endless_wait	LIMIT	-	docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-07-phase-6-1-loose-ends.md section 4: a deadlock in the simulation mode is a loud refusal; virtual time cannot end a wait only a real signal can
+sim_foreign_post	LIMIT	-	docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-07-phase-6-1-loose-ends.md section 4: any inbox post other than a signal's halt is a determinism breach, refused loudly
 stale_handle	DEVIATION	-	exclusions row "A LOCAL HANDLE KEPT FROM AN EARLIER CALL IS STILL REFUSED": a local reference used after its call is outside the API
 store_op_off_its_node	GUARD	-	compiler invariant: a Store op names its own assignment (census d-guard)
 unknown_receiver	GUARD	-	scout A b9 b11_ctx_exec_* and weak reference sends b_weakref_*, b2_run_hasmethod_on_weakref; Task 7 probes rc4 (a Method copy refuses at COPY first); the rest are handles whose object is gone or kinds receiver_kind has no arm for
 unreadable_collection	GUARD	-	scout A b18: env_supplier; with no owner it is a directory holding an entry the library bootstrap fills, and only STDQUE (Phase 10) refused
 unsatisfiable_wait	LIMIT	-	Deviation 20 (rulings P27, P65, P77)
